# A great reptile is a beast in all but its body: it is appeased and tamed the same way, and then
# stands in the party on the reptile anatomy — no claws, horns on the muzzle, a thagomizer on the
# trunk — drawn from its own art (assets/art/body/reptile) and fighting through its own two mediums.
#
# The Test Yard rather than the Test Den: the den has a wolf of its own, which takes the threat
# observation ahead of --observe-only.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --location-type test --location-id 0 --npc-static --start-area "Test Yard" --period noon --spawn-beast crocodile --observe-only crocodile

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60
advance 12 180

# --- appease, then tame (see cli/verb/tame/success.cli) ---------------------------
strategy succeed
goal appease
click keyword 0
choose 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
click action 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180
expect Appeasement

click button
wait 60
advance 12 180

goal tame
click keyword 0
choose 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
click action 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180
expect Joined you
expect-outcome recruited

# --- the companion's body: the reptile anatomy, with its two weapons ----------------
manage Anatomy
wait 20
manage member 1
wait 20
expect Reptile
expect Crocodile
expect Horns
expect Thagomizer
expect-not Claws

# --- and its fighting mediums -------------------------------------------------------
manage Bellic
wait 20
expect reptile anatomy
expect Gore
expect Tail Lash
manage
wait 20

quit
